<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects 120 bln esc, 6.701 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects 120 bln esc, 6.701 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 120 billion escudos of three-day funds into the money market at a weighted average rate of 6.7011 percent in a variable rate repurchase tender.</p>
<p>The rate compared with 6.70 percent previously.</p>
<p>It offered 120 billion escudos in today's repo.</p>
<p>-- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
